@ { 6 labels } -> 131x8 GROB of soft key labels ("" leaves a key blank)
\<< \-> labels
  \<< #131d #8d BLANK
    1 6 FOR j
      labels j GET
      IF DUP SIZE THEN
        j 1 - 22 * \-> x
        \<<
          SWAP x R\->B #0d 2 \->LIST #21d #8d BLANK NEG REPL
          SWAP 1 \->GROB NEG DUP SIZE DROP B\->R 21 SWAP - 2 / IP x + R\->B #1d 2 \->LIST SWAP REPL
        \>>
      ELSE DROP END
    NEXT
  \>>
\>>
